      <title></title>
      <link>https://qgis-cameroun-eight.vercel.app/rules/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://qgis-cameroun-eight.vercel.app/rules/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;is-hidden-touch edit-on-github&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;a&#xA;        class=&#34;button is-light is-small is-rounded&#34;&#xA;        href=&#34;https://github.com/qgis/QGIS-User-Group-Website//edit/main/content/rules.md&#34;&#xA;        target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;        rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&#xA;    &gt;&#xA;        &lt;span class=&#34;icon&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;i class=&#34;fab fa-github&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;        &lt;span&gt;Edit on GitHub&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;section class=&#34;section  pt-3&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;container content&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &#xA;        &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;internal-regulations-of-the-qgis-cameroon-association&#34;&gt;&#xA;    Internal Regulations of the QGIS Cameroon Association&#xA;    &lt;a class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; href=&#34;#internal-regulations-of-the-qgis-cameroon-association&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#x9;    ¶&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supplementary document to the Association&amp;rsquo;s Statutes, detailing in particular the organization of roles and progressive involvement.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;em&gt;Draft submitted to the Constitutive General Assembly, Yaoundé, Republic of Cameroon — 2026&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;table-of-contents&#34;&gt;&#xA;    Table of Contents&#xA;    &lt;a class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; href=&#34;#table-of-contents&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#x9;    ¶&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Title I&lt;/strong&gt; — General Provisions&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Title II&lt;/strong&gt; — Members of the Association&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Title III&lt;/strong&gt; — Association Bodies&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Title IV&lt;/strong&gt; — Organization of Thematic Poles and Regional Branches&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Title V&lt;/strong&gt; — Roles and Progressive Designation of Responsibilities&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Title VI&lt;/strong&gt; — Meeting Operations&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Title VII&lt;/strong&gt; — Resources and Financial Management&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Title VIII&lt;/strong&gt; — Communication and Use of the Association&amp;rsquo;s Image&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Title IX&lt;/strong&gt; — Discipline&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Title X&lt;/strong&gt; — Amendment of the Internal Regulations and Final Provisions&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;title-i--general-provisions&#34;&gt;&#xA;    Title I — General Provisions&#xA;    &lt;a class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; href=&#34;#title-i--general-provisions&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#x9;    ¶&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Article 1 — Object of the internal regulations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;These internal regulations supplement the Statutes of the QGIS Cameroon Association (hereinafter &amp;ldquo;the Association&amp;rdquo;), established in accordance with Law No. 90/053 of December 19, 1990, on the freedom of association, as amended by Law No. 99/014 of December 22, 1999. They specify the practical modalities for the operation of the bodies, member categories, organization into thematic poles and regional branches, as well as the mechanism for the progressive designation of leadership roles.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
